module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.refusal_reabsorbed_by_intermediate_default

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data refusal_reabsorbed_by_intermediate_default: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "refusal_reabsorbed_by_intermediate_default" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**a refusal is only a refusal if it SURVIVES ITS CALLER -- a producer can be correct at its inability boundary while the composed path still fabricates an answer** (INVALID STATE: a producer returns its typed empty or refusal at an explicit inability boundary, and an intermediate consumer reads that outcome as permission to substitute a default, a nickname, a shallower identity, or an empty-success. The composed path widens even though the producing site is correct in isolation. HARM: the fabricated value reaches a judgment site that believes it is comparing real data, so a mismatch that should have been loud is silently admitted -- section 5's forbidden state, reached by a route in which no single frame did anything obviously wrong.)",

    "WHY SITE-LOCAL REVIEW IS STRUCTURALLY BLIND TO IT, WHICH IS THE WHOLE REASON IT IS A CLASS. Inspection at the producer sees the intended refusal. A unit test at the producer sees the intended refusal. A reviewer reading the diff that ADDS the refusal sees a correct refusal being added. Only following the outcome through EVERY consumer reveals that a later frame absorbs it and recreates an answer -- and nothing in the producer's diff points at the frame that will do so. The defect is not in any line you would think to look at.",

    "MEASURED INSTANCE, gunbc#10146: carried_structural_type_name was repaired to return empty at its depth-16 ceiling -- correct, and correct in isolation. Its PARENT FRAME converted that empty back to `here`, so declared_alias_target_matches_produced continued to receive a fabricated shallow identity and alias admission continued to succeed. The first repair was therefore indistinguishable from no repair at the only site that decides, and it was caught on a full-path reread rather than at the edit. THE FIRST FIX WAS ITSELF AN INSTANCE OF THE CLASS IT WAS FIXING.",

    "DISTINGUISHING WITNESS, and note that it must assert at the JUDGMENT SITE and not at the producer: construct a chain that reaches the inability boundary, then assert AT THE FINAL JUDGMENT SITE that no fallback identity or value is admitted and the typed refusal or loud mismatch survives unchanged. A witness that asserts at the producer passes against both the broken and the repaired composition and therefore discriminates nothing.",

    "REPAIR RULE: A REFUSAL IS ABSORBING ACROSS THE FULL CALLER CHAIN. Consumers may propagate a typed cause or enrich it; none may translate it into a default, a nickname, a shallower identity, an empty-success, or an acceptance. The rule is stated over the chain rather than over any frame, because every frame in the observed instance was locally defensible.",

    "BOUNDARY AGAINST THE ABSORBING-FALLBACK ROW, WHICH IS ADJACENT AND NOT THE SAME. There, a FAILURE ARM widens instead of refusing -- the producer is the defect, and the repair is to make that arm refuse. Here the producer ALREADY REFUSES CORRECTLY and a CONSUMER undoes it. Different site, different repair, and no single capability retires both: making failure arms refuse does nothing about a caller that re-absorbs a correct refusal.",

    "RUNG FOUND AT: mitigatable, and the mitigation was a human performing a full-path reread after a review flagged the site. CEILING: structurally guaranteed -- a typed refusal whose absorption by a consumer is not expressible cannot appear in an Accepted program, and the decidable fact is whether any frame maps a refusal outcome onto a non-refusal value. NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, stated as a CAPABILITY and deliberately not as an artifact: the compiler can decide, for a producer's refusal outcome, whether every consumer on every path either propagates it or refuses -- and refuses the program when one converts it to a value. Adding the depth-ceiling witness, or repairing this one parent frame, satisfies none of that and leaves every other producer-consumer pair in the tree exposed identically.",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
